---
// Features — theme-aware
---

<section id="features" class="section" style="background: var(--bg-raised);">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="label">Fonctionnalités</span>
        <h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em]" style="color: var(--fg);">
          Conçu pour les<br class="hidden sm:inline" /> traders sérieux.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed md:text-right" style="color: var(--fg-secondary);">
        Chaque fonctionnalité est conçue pour réduire la friction entre votre idée stratégique
        et son exécution sur le marché.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 md:mt-16 lg:mt-20 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 sm:gap-4 gsap-stagger-grid">
      <!-- Feature 1: Large -->
      <div class="min-w-0 col-span-12 md:col-span-7 p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8 transition-colors duration-300 group" style="border: 1px solid var(--border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='var(--border-hover)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='var(--border)'">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center" style="border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 16L8.5 8L12.5 12L16 4" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--fg);">Backtest institutionnel</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-lg" style="color: var(--fg-secondary);">
          Notre moteur traite 500 000+ événements par seconde avec une précision tick-level.
          La simulation d'exécution réaliste prend en compte le spread, le slippage et l'impact marché.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-5" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <div><div class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--fg);">500K+</div><div class="mt-1 text-xs" style="color: var(--fg-muted);">événements/sec</div></div>
            <div><div class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--fg);">10ans+</div><div class="mt-1 text-xs" style="color: var(--fg-muted);">données historiques</div></div>
            <div><div class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--fg);">40+</div><div class="mt-1 text-xs" style="color: var(--fg-muted);">bourses</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Tall -->
      <div class="min-w-0 col-span-12 md:col-span-5 p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8 transition-colors duration-300 flex flex-col group" style="border: 1px solid var(--border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='var(--border-hover)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='var(--border)'">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center" style="border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><rect x="2" y="2" width="16" height="16" rx="2" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M6 10L9 13L14 7" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--fg);">Gestion des risques</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--fg-secondary);">
          Dimensionnement de positions, limites de drawdown et surveillance de l'exposition intégrés.
          Définissez des disjoncteurs qui arrêtent le trading automatiquement.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto pt-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
            <span style="color: var(--fg-muted);">Drawdown max</span>
            <span style="color: var(--fg-secondary);">-2.1%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="h-1" style="background: var(--border);"><div class="h-full" style="width: 21%; background: var(--fg);"></div></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
            <span style="color: var(--fg-muted);">Limite perte jour</span>
            <span style="color: var(--fg-secondary);">$0 / $50K</span>
          </div>
          <div class="h-1" style="background: var(--border);"><div class="h-full" style="width: 0%; background: var(--fg-muted);"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="min-w-0 col-span-12 md:col-span-4 p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8 transition-colors duration-300 group" style="border: 1px solid var(--border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='var(--border-hover)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='var(--border)'">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center" style="border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10 2V18M2 10H18" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="3" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--fg);">Multi-actifs</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--fg-secondary);">
          Actions, futures, options, crypto et FX. Construisez des stratégies inter-actifs
          avec un système unifié de gestion des ordres.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4 -->
      <div class="min-w-0 col-span-12 md:col-span-4 p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8 transition-colors duration-300 group" style="border: 1px solid var(--border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='var(--border-hover)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='var(--border)'">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center" style="border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 3H7V7H3V3ZM13 3H17V7H13V3ZM3 13H7V17H3V13ZM13 13H17V17H13V13Z" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--fg);">Surveillance en temps réel</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--fg-secondary);">
          P&L en direct, suivi des positions et journaux d'exécution.
          Savoir exactement ce que fait votre stratégie à tout moment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5 -->
      <div class="min-w-0 col-span-12 md:col-span-4 p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8 transition-colors duration-300 group" style="border: 1px solid var(--border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='var(--border-hover)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='var(--border)'">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center" style="border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 4L10 4L10 10L16 10" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M10 4L16 4L16 10" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--fg);">API-First</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--fg-secondary);">
          Tout disponible via nos APIs REST et WebSocket. Intégrez Algokreation
          dans votre infrastructure existante sans friction.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
